@startuml
title 预约状态图

hide empty description
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #183241
skinparam titleFontSize 23
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam titleFontColor #153746
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.25
skinparam nodesep 34
skinparam ranksep 34
skinparam stateFontSize 16
skinparam stateArrowFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #52677A
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F0F5F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #45617A
skinparam stateStartColor #36556F

state "有效预约 · 占用商品" as Active {
  state "待卖家确认" as Pending #FFF2DD
  state "卖家已确认" as Confirmed #E7F4EF
  Pending : 确认截止取创建后 24 小时\n与约定交付时间中的较早者
  [*] --> Pending
  Pending -right[#207266]-> Confirmed : 本单卖家接受\n[服务器时间早于截止]
}
state "已拒绝" as Rejected
state "已过期" as Expired
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "已完成" as Completed #E7F4EF

[*] --> Active : / 创建预约并保存约定快照\n商品进入已预约
Pending --> Rejected : 本单卖家拒绝 [有原因]\n/ 普通释放
Pending --> Expired : 到达确认截止\n[仍关联该预约] / 普通释放
Pending --> Cancelled : 本单买家取消\n/ 普通释放
Confirmed --> Cancelled : 本单买家或卖家取消\n[有原因] / 普通释放
Confirmed -down[#207266]-> Completed : 本单买家确认收到实物\n/ 商品已售出，\n保存首次完成时间
Active -down[#A33E51]-> Cancelled : 管理员封禁商品\n/ 记录平台原因，通知双方\n商品保持已封禁
Rejected -right[hidden]-> Expired
Expired -right[hidden]-> Completed
Completed -right[hidden]-> Cancelled
@enduml
